            <ArticleTitle>The establishment of Bayesian Coronary Artery Disease Prediction model.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>925</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This poster will demonstrate how we build up the module of Bayesian Coronary Artery Disease Predicting Evidence-Based Medicine. The system-module may help the young professional understand the effect of factors for referring patients to take the invasive examination of Angiographic.Moreover, the non-invasive information-tech also can perform as the screening tool on a clinical or a community-based epidemiology.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
